[00:10.65]1. Many are the weaknesses
[00:21.31]That we all possess.
[00:31.96]Still Jehovah cares for us,
[00:37.96]Loves us nonetheless.
[00:45.02]He is so merciful;
[00:51.16]His love, so powerful.
[00:59.02]May we show this kind of love,
[01:05.32]Help those in distress.
[01:21.12]2. Some at times are weak in faith,
[01:26.68]Strong though they appear.
[01:32.25]By our reassuring words,
[01:37.82]We can calm their fears.
[01:43.39]Weak ones to God belong;
[01:52.39]His spirit makes them strong.
[01:58.39]May we feel their pain and cares,
[02:04.39]Help them dry their tears.
[02:29.46]3. Rather than condemn the weak,
[02:54.52]We should bear in mind
[03:00.67]How much we can strengthen them
[03:06.17]By our being kind.
[03:12.67]May we be diligent,
[03:18.17]Give them encouragement.
[03:28.12]As we lend our kind support,
[03:42.04]Comfort they will find.